{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the bathroom or defend your home from zombies? The choice is yours! Be Human... Or Die trying is a 1-8 player co-op defense game where killing zombies is just as important as taking a shower. Also did I mention that you play an alien in a mech suit? Yeah it's a weird game like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHOOT ZOMBIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join up to 8 other players as you shoot zombies and defend your home while trying to complete strange objectives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814400/extras/af32b779986ee45ec1e3660bc06d3e92.poster.avif?t=1772834097\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814400/extras/af32b779986ee45ec1e3660bc06d3e92.webm?t=1772834097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814400/extras/af32b779986ee45ec1e3660bc06d3e92.mp4?t=1772834097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARRANGE FURNITURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well furnished and well arranged home is the difference between victory and defeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814400/extras/b809e1e3da1f28546f54b2fe1d51425a.poster.avif?t=1772834097\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814400/extras/b809e1e3da1f28546f54b2fe1d51425a.webm?t=1772834097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814400/extras/b809e1e3da1f28546f54b2fe1d51425a.m